{"real": true, "dur": 56.56, "sent": [{"start": 0.24, "end": 4.52, "text": "So how do I take what I’ve built for French and adapt it to Chinese?", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 0.24}, {"w": "how", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "do", "s": 1.02}, {"w": "I", "s": 1.22}, {"w": "take", "s": 1.36}, {"w": "what", "s": 1.6}, {"w": "I’ve", "s": 1.88}, {"w": "built", "s": 2.1}, {"w": "for", "s": 2.44}, {"w": "French", "s": 2.62}, {"w": "and", "s": 3.14}, {"w": "adapt", "s": 3.28}, {"w": "it", "s": 3.66}, {"w": "to", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "Chinese?", "s": 4.0}]}, {"start": 5.34, "end": 6.56, "text": "I do it in three steps.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 5.34}, {"w": "do", "s": 5.46}, {"w": "it", "s": 5.58}, {"w": "in", "s": 5.76}, {"w": "three", "s": 5.92}, {"w": "steps.", "s": 6.24}]}, {"start": 7.46, "end": 9.44, "text": "Step one: keep the frame.", "words": [{"w": "Step", "s": 7.46}, {"w": "one:", "s": 7.8}, {"w": "keep", "s": 8.52}, {"w": "the", "s": 8.96}, {"w": "frame.", "s": 9.14}]}, {"start": 9.98, "end": 15.06, "text": "In other words, build the parts that work for any language just once.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 9.98}, {"w": "other", "s": 10.14}, {"w": "words,", "s": 10.34}, {"w": "build", "s": 11.04}, {"w": "the", "s": 11.3}, {"w": "parts", "s": 11.46}, {"w": "that", "s": 12.08}, {"w": "work", "s": 12.32}, {"w": "for", "s": 12.82}, {"w": "any", "s": 13.14}, {"w": "language", "s": 13.38}, {"w": "just", "s": 14.22}, {"w": "once.", "s": 14.7}]}, {"start": 15.54, "end": 20.78, "text": "There are also two important rules built into it: the catalogue and the spiral.", "words": [{"w": "There", "s": 15.54}, {"w": "are", "s": 15.64}, {"w": "also", "s": 15.8}, {"w": "two", "s": 16.14}, {"w": "important", "s": 16.42}, {"w": "rules", "s": 16.96}, {"w": "built", "s": 17.54}, {"w": "into", "s": 17.92}, {"w": "it:", "s": 18.22}, {"w": "the", "s": 19.0}, {"w": "catalogue", "s": 19.16}, {"w": "and", "s": 20.0}, {"w": "the", "s": 20.14}, {"w": "spiral.", "s": 20.36}]}, {"start": 21.22, "end": 22.56, "text": "I’ll come to those in a moment.", "words": [{"w": "I’ll", "s": 21.22}, {"w": "come", "s": 21.38}, {"w": "to", "s": 21.58}, {"w": "those", "s": 21.7}, {"w": "in", "s": 21.98}, {"w": "a", "s": 22.08}, {"w": "moment.", "s": 22.18}]}, {"start": 23.18, "end": 25.24, "text": "Step two: change the settings.", "words": [{"w": "Step", "s": 23.18}, {"w": "two:", "s": 23.44}, {"w": "change", "s": 24.14}, {"w": "the", "s": 24.58}, {"w": "settings.", "s": 24.76}]}, {"start": 25.74, "end": 30.84, "text": "That means the exercises still work the same way, but learners make different choices.", "words": [{"w": "That", "s": 25.74}, {"w": "means", "s": 25.92}, {"w": "the", "s": 26.2}, {"w": "exercises", "s": 26.36}, {"w": "still", "s": 27.06}, {"w": "work", "s": 27.42}, {"w": "the", "s": 27.68}, {"w": "same", "s": 27.84}, {"w": "way,", "s": 28.14}, {"w": "but", "s": 28.94}, {"w": "learners", "s": 29.16}, {"w": "make", "s": 29.66}, {"w": "different", "s": 29.94}, {"w": "choices.", "s": 30.3}]}, {"start": 31.86, "end": 34.02, "text": "Step three: fill the slots.", "words": [{"w": "Step", "s": 31.86}, {"w": "three:", "s": 32.22}, {"w": "fill", "s": 33.18}, {"w": "the", "s": 33.46}, {"w": "slots.", "s": 33.64}]}, {"start": 34.4, "end": 39.3, "text": "That means using the new textbook to work out what learners need to be able to do.", "words": [{"w": "That", "s": 34.4}, {"w": "means", "s": 34.58}, {"w": "using", "s": 35.34}, {"w": "the", "s": 35.66}, {"w": "new", "s": 35.84}, {"w": "textbook", "s": 36.06}, {"w": "to", "s": 36.56}, {"w": "work", "s": 36.76}, {"w": "out", "s": 37.02}, {"w": "what", "s": 37.26}, {"w": "learners", "s": 37.48}, {"w": "need", "s": 37.94}, {"w": "to", "s": 38.18}, {"w": "be", "s": 38.34}, {"w": "able", "s": 38.58}, {"w": "to", "s": 38.88}, {"w": "do.", "s": 39.06}]}, {"start": 39.76, "end": 43.06, "text": "And this third step is where the teacher does the real work.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 39.76}, {"w": "this", "s": 40.02}, {"w": "third", "s": 40.26}, {"w": "step", "s": 40.54}, {"w": "is", "s": 40.9}, {"w": "where", "s": 41.16}, {"w": "the", "s": 41.42}, {"w": "teacher", "s": 41.6}, {"w": "does", "s": 42.08}, {"w": "the", "s": 42.36}, {"w": "real", "s": 42.58}, {"w": "work.", "s": 42.82}]}, {"start": 43.56, "end": 45.68, "text": "To picture it, think of a loom.", "words": [{"w": "To", "s": 43.56}, {"w": "picture", "s": 43.8}, {"w": "it,", "s": 44.26}, {"w": "think", "s": 44.66}, {"w": "of", "s": 44.94}, {"w": "a", "s": 45.16}, {"w": "loom.", "s": 45.36}]}, {"start": 46.18, "end": 47.58, "text": "The loom stays the same.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 46.18}, {"w": "loom", "s": 46.38}, {"w": "stays", "s": 46.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 47.08}, {"w": "same.", "s": 47.28}]}, {"start": 48.06, "end": 48.88, "text": "That’s the frame.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 48.06}, {"w": "the", "s": 48.36}, {"w": "frame.", "s": 48.56}]}, {"start": 49.52, "end": 52.74, "text": "But the thread and pattern change with each language.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 49.52}, {"w": "the", "s": 49.7}, {"w": "thread", "s": 49.92}, {"w": "and", "s": 50.36}, {"w": "pattern", "s": 50.6}, {"w": "change", "s": 51.16}, {"w": "with", "s": 51.56}, {"w": "each", "s": 51.9}, {"w": "language.", "s": 52.22}]}, {"start": 53.3, "end": 55.84, "text": "Now let’s take the steps one at a time.", "words": [{"w": "Now", "s": 53.3}, {"w": "let’s", "s": 53.78}, {"w": "take", "s": 54.08}, {"w": "the", "s": 54.26}, {"w": "steps", "s": 54.44}, {"w": "one", "s": 55.1}, {"w": "at", "s": 55.32}, {"w": "a", "s": 55.44}, {"w": "time.", "s": 55.56}]}]}